<title>USA: PLDT cuts quarterly cash dividend.</title>
<headline>PLDT cuts quarterly cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Long Distnace Telephone Co said Wednesday it was cutting its quarterly cash dividend to 1.20 pesos per share from 1.60 pesos.</p>
<p>The lower dividend will be paid on all dividend declarations after June 30, the company said.</p>
<p>Yesterday the company declared a 100 percent stock dividend, subject to shareholder approval, payable June 30, record May 15.</p>
